---
manual: art.rect.styles
lines: [1770, 1778]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @box = rect top: 20, left: 10, width: 30, height: 40, curve: 5
end
----------- test code
box = rect("@box")
assert_equal [10, 20], [box.left, box.top], "left: and top: place the rectangle"
assert_equal [30, 40], [box.width, box.height], "width: and height: size it"
assert_equal 5, box.curve, "curve: rounds its corners"
